          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "TL 0508 3/7 HIGH STREET (East Side) No 109 18.6.48. GV II* Early C19.  Stucco front, low pitched roof behind parapet.  2 storeys, lst floor pair of triple light sash windows with glazing bars.  Moulded cornice, rounded angle on right.  Long early C19 shop front to ground floor with rounded corner on right, glazing bars, slim reeded pilasters, entablature, central entrance with oblong fanlight, half glazed 2 fold doors. Nos 103 to 111 (odd) and 107A form a group. Listing NGR: TL0548908016"
    }
